# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the SQOA framework {#understand-the-sqoa-framework}"
msgstr "Memahami kerangka kerja SQOA {#understand-the-sqoa-framework}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) [\\[2\\]](#references) combines Quantum Random Access Optimization (QRAO) with sample-based quantum diagonalization:\n"
msgstr "Sampling-based Quantum Optimization Algorithm with Quantum Relaxation (SQOA-QR) [\\[2\\]](#references) menggabungkan Quantum Random Access Optimization (QRAO) dengan sample-based quantum diagonalization:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Quantum relaxation and encoding:** SQOA Solver converts the QUBO to a minimization Ising objective of the form $c + \\sum_i h_i z_i + \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij} z_i z_j$, where $z_i \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$. QRAO [\\[3\\]](#references) then maps each spin variable to a Pauli observable. For the $(3,1)$-QRAC encoding used here, the relaxed Hamiltonian is\n"
msgstr "**Relaksasi dan encoding kuantum:** SQOA Solver mengubah QUBO menjadi fungsi objektif Ising minimisasi berbentuk $c + \\sum_i h_i z_i + \\sum_{i<j} J_{ij} z_i z_j$, dengan $z_i \\in \\{-1, +1\\}$. QRAO [\\[3\\]](#references) kemudian memetakan setiap variabel spin ke sebuah observabel Pauli. Untuk encoding $(3,1)$-QRAC yang dipakai di sini, Hamiltonian terelaksasinya adalah\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\widetilde{H} = cI + \\sum_i \\sqrt{k_i} h_i P_{f(i)} + \\sum_{i<j} \\sqrt{k_i k_j} J_{ij} P_{f(i)} P_{f(j)},\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   \\widetilde{H} = cI + \\sum_i \\sqrt{k_i} h_i P_{f(i)} + \\sum_{i<j} \\sqrt{k_i k_j} J_{ij} P_{f(i)} P_{f(j)},\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   where $I$ is the identity operator, $f(i)$ assigns variable $i$ to a qubit and one of $X$, $Y$, or $Z$, and $k_i \\in \\{1,2,3\\}$ is the number of variables mapped to the same qubit as $i$. When both relevant qubits contain three variables, the linear and quadratic scaling factors become $\\sqrt{3}$ and $3$, respectively.\n"
msgstr "   dengan $I$ adalah operator identitas, $f(i)$ menetapkan variabel $i$ ke sebuah qubit dan salah satu dari $X$, $Y$, atau $Z$, dan $k_i \\in \\{1,2,3\\}$ adalah jumlah variabel yang dipetakan ke qubit yang sama dengan $i$. Ketika kedua qubit yang relevan berisi tiga variabel, faktor skala linear dan kuadratik masing-masing menjadi $\\sqrt{3}$ dan $3$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   Variables that share a qubit are assigned different noncommuting Pauli observables. Variables that interact in the QUBO are kept on different qubits, while variables with no direct QUBO interaction can share a qubit. The reduction in qubit count therefore depends on the structure of the problem.\n"
"2. **Quantum sampling:** A quantum processor samples bitstrings from circuits designed to explore low-energy states of the relaxed Hamiltonian.\n"
"3. **Sample-based diagonalization:** The solver projects the relaxed Hamiltonian onto the subspace spanned by basis states obtained from the sampled bitstrings and diagonalizes the projected Hamiltonian classically [\\[4\\]](#references), [\\[5\\]](#references). For a fixed set of sampled bitstrings, let $\\mathcal{S}_r$ be the subspace spanned by $r$ distinct basis states, so $\\dim(\\mathcal{S}_r) \\leq r$. Its estimated ground-state energy is:\n"
msgstr ""
"   Variabel yang berbagi qubit ditetapkan ke observabel Pauli noncommuting yang berbeda. Variabel yang berinteraksi dalam QUBO ditempatkan pada qubit berbeda, sedangkan variabel tanpa interaksi QUBO langsung bisa berbagi qubit. Jadi pengurangan jumlah qubit bergantung pada struktur masalah.\n"
"2. **Sampling kuantum:** Prosesor kuantum mengambil sampel bitstring dari circuit yang dirancang untuk menjelajahi keadaan berenergi rendah dari Hamiltonian terelaksasi.\n"
"3. **Diagonalisasi berbasis sampel:** Solver memproyeksikan Hamiltonian terelaksasi ke subruang yang direntang oleh keadaan basis dari bitstring hasil sampling, lalu mendiagonalisasi Hamiltonian terproyeksi secara klasik [\\[4\\]](#references), [\\[5\\]](#references). Untuk himpunan bitstring sampel yang tetap, misalkan $\\mathcal{S}_r$ adalah subruang yang direntang oleh $r$ keadaan basis berbeda, sehingga $\\dim(\\mathcal{S}_r) \\leq r$. Estimasi energi keadaan dasarnya adalah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   $$\n"
"   E_r = \\min_{\\substack{|\\psi\\rangle \\in \\mathcal{S}_r \\\\ \\langle\\psi|\\psi\\rangle=1}} \\langle\\psi|\\widetilde{H}|\\psi\\rangle, \\qquad \\mathcal{S}_r \\subseteq \\mathcal{S}_{r'} \\Longrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{exact}} \\leq E_{r'} \\leq E_r \\quad (r' \\geq r),\n"
"   $$\n"
msgstr ""
"   $$\n"
"   E_r = \\min_{\\substack{|\\psi\\rangle \\in \\mathcal{S}_r \\\\ \\langle\\psi|\\psi\\rangle=1}} \\langle\\psi|\\widetilde{H}|\\psi\\rangle, \\qquad \\mathcal{S}_r \\subseteq \\mathcal{S}_{r'} \\Longrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{exact}} \\leq E_{r'} \\leq E_r \\quad (r' \\geq r),\n"
"   $$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   where $E_{\\mathrm{exact}}$ is the ground-state energy of the full relaxed Hamiltonian. Therefore, a larger retained subspace cannot increase the estimated ground-state energy.\n"
msgstr "   dengan $E_{\\mathrm{exact}}$ adalah energi keadaan dasar dari Hamiltonian terelaksasi penuh. Karena itu, subruang yang dipertahankan lebih besar tidak bisa menaikkan estimasi energi keadaan dasar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   This ordering assumes the same sampling result and concerns the relaxed-Hamiltonian energy before rounding. It does not theoretically guarantee a better returned classical solution. However, in QRAO, a lower-energy state is heuristically expected to provide a better classical solution.\n"
"4. **Rounding:** The relaxed state obtained from the diagonalization is converted into a classical binary assignment.\n"
msgstr ""
"   Urutan ini mengasumsikan hasil sampling yang sama dan menyangkut energi Hamiltonian terelaksasi sebelum pembulatan. Ini tidak menjamin secara teoretis solusi klasik yang dikembalikan lebih baik. Meski begitu, dalam QRAO, keadaan berenergi lebih rendah secara heuristik diharapkan memberi solusi klasik yang lebih baik.\n"
"4. **Pembulatan:** Keadaan terelaksasi hasil diagonalisasi diubah menjadi penetapan biner klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver surrounds this framework with classical processing. Before the quantum mapping, presolve applies reduction rules that can fix variables and simplify the remaining QUBO while preserving at least one optimal solution. After the diagonalization and rounding, a classical local search refines the assignment, and OMMX reconstructs and evaluates the complete solution.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver membungkus kerangka kerja ini dengan pemrosesan klasik. Sebelum pemetaan kuantum, presolve menerapkan aturan reduksi yang dapat menetapkan variabel dan menyederhanakan QUBO yang tersisa sambil mempertahankan setidaknya satu solusi optimal. Setelah diagonalisasi dan pembulatan, local search klasik menyempurnakan penetapan, dan OMMX merekonstruksi serta mengevaluasi solusi lengkapnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load the instance {#load-the-instance}"
msgstr "Memuat instans {#load-the-instance}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QOBLIB distributes each MIS instance as a graph in the DIMACS `.gph` format, a line-based format in which the line starting with `p` gives the numbers of nodes and edges and each line starting with `e` defines an edge.\n"
msgstr "QOBLIB mendistribusikan setiap instans MIS sebagai graf dalam format DIMACS `.gph`, format berbasis baris di mana baris yang diawali `p` memberikan jumlah node dan sisi, dan setiap baris yang diawali `e` mendefinisikan sebuah sisi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QOBLIB also publishes an optimal or best-known reference solution for each instance. The following functions download both from the QOBLIB repository. DIMACS labels nodes starting from 1, so the graph is relabeled to start from 0.\n"
msgstr "QOBLIB juga menerbitkan solusi referensi optimal atau terbaik yang diketahui untuk setiap instans. Fungsi-fungsi berikut mengunduh keduanya dari repositori QOBLIB. DIMACS memberi label node mulai dari 1, jadi graf diberi label ulang agar mulai dari 0.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to start from your own graph instead, skip the download and formulate the problem from your NetworkX graph in the same way.\n"
msgstr "Kalau Anda ingin mulai dari graf Anda sendiri, lewati pengunduhan dan rumuskan masalah dari graf NetworkX Anda dengan cara yang sama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use the objective value of the reference solution later to assess the result from SQOA Solver. This tutorial solves this problem on a device with 156 qubits.\n"
msgstr "Anda memakai nilai objektif dari solusi referensi nanti untuk menilai hasil dari SQOA Solver. Tutorial ini menyelesaikan masalah ini pada perangkat dengan 156 qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the graph. Later, you also use it to verify that the nodes returned by SQOA Solver form an independent set.\n"
msgstr "Visualisasikan grafnya. Nanti, graf ini juga dipakai untuk memverifikasi bahwa node yang dikembalikan SQOA Solver membentuk independent set.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/7c0c796c-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/7c0c796c-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Formulate the QUBO {#formulate-the-qubo}"
msgstr "Merumuskan QUBO {#formulate-the-qubo}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the binary linear formulation from the Background section as an `OptimizationProblem` with one binary variable per node, an objective that counts the selected nodes, and one constraint per edge. Then convert it with `OptimizationProblemToQubo`.\n"
msgstr "Bangun perumusan linear biner dari bagian Latar Belakang sebagai `OptimizationProblem` dengan satu variabel biner per node, fungsi objektif yang menghitung node terpilih, dan satu batasan per sisi. Lalu konversi dengan `OptimizationProblemToQubo`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With a penalty weight of 2, the converter replaces each edge constraint with the penalty term $2 x_v x_w$ and turns the maximization into a minimization, so the converted problem is QOBLIB's binary unconstrained formulation with its sign reversed. The QUBO's variable indices are the graph's node labels. The `IndependentSet` application class in `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` builds the same constrained model with `IndependentSet(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"
msgstr "Dengan bobot penalti 2, konverter mengganti setiap batasan sisi dengan suku penalti $2 x_v x_w$ dan mengubah maksimisasi menjadi minimisasi, sehingga masalah hasil konversi adalah perumusan biner tanpa batasan dari QOBLIB dengan tanda terbalik. Indeks variabel QUBO adalah label node graf. Kelas aplikasi `IndependentSet` di `qiskit_addon_opt_mapper.applications` membangun model berbatasan yang sama dengan `IndependentSet(G).to_optimization_problem()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, convert the QUBO to the dictionary format with `to_problem_dict()`. Because the problem is a binary QUBO, the request in Step 2 declares its variable domain as `\"binary\"`. The function performs presolve, quantum mapping, and circuit construction after submission.\n"
msgstr "Terakhir, konversi QUBO ke format dictionary dengan `to_problem_dict()`. Karena masalahnya adalah QUBO biner, permintaan di Langkah 2 mendeklarasikan domain variabelnya sebagai `\"binary\"`. Function melakukan presolve, pemetaan kuantum, dan konstruksi circuit setelah pengiriman.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize the problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-the-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimalkan masalah untuk eksekusi di perangkat keras kuantum {#step-2-optimize-the-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver performs the quantum mapping and hardware preparation inside the function. It first applies presolve to the QUBO, then maps the remaining variables to a relaxed Hamiltonian by using a QRAC-based encoding.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver melakukan pemetaan kuantum dan persiapan perangkat keras di dalam function. Pertama ia menerapkan presolve pada QUBO, lalu memetakan variabel yang tersisa ke Hamiltonian terelaksasi dengan encoding berbasis QRAC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For quantum sampling, it constructs circuits based on the relaxed Hamiltonian and transpiles them for the selected backend. The problem-size and qubit reductions from presolve and encoding depend on the problem, so configure the solver without assuming a fixed reduction factor.\n"
msgstr "Untuk sampling kuantum, ia membangun circuit berdasarkan Hamiltonian terelaksasi dan men-transpile-nya untuk backend yang dipilih. Pengurangan ukuran masalah dan jumlah qubit dari presolve dan encoding bergantung pada masalahnya, jadi konfigurasikan solver tanpa mengasumsikan faktor reduksi yang tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure the solver inputs {#configure-the-solver-inputs}"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi input solver {#configure-the-solver-inputs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver requires two inputs:\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver memerlukan dua input:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`problem`, the dictionary from Step 1.\n"
msgstr "`problem`, dictionary dari Langkah 1.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`variable_type`, which is `\"binary\"` for this QUBO.\n"
msgstr "`variable_type`, yaitu `\"binary\"` untuk QUBO ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It also accepts two optional inputs:\n"
msgstr "Ia juga menerima dua input opsional:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`backend_name` selects the QPU. When it is omitted or `None`, the function selects the least busy operational QPU that is accessible to your instance.\n"
msgstr "`backend_name` memilih QPU. Jika dihilangkan atau `None`, function memilih QPU operasional yang paling tidak sibuk dan dapat diakses oleh instance Anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`options` is a dictionary that controls the sampling budget (`shots`), the classical seed (`seed`), session usage (`session`), the classical local search (`postprocessing_level`), and job tags (`job_tags`). If you increase `shots`, the sampling statistics can improve.\n"
msgstr "`options` adalah dictionary yang mengatur anggaran sampling (`shots`), seed klasik (`seed`), penggunaan session (`session`), local search klasik (`postprocessing_level`), dan tag job (`job_tags`). Jika Anda menaikkan `shots`, statistik sampling bisa membaik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For all inputs, their default values, and validation rules, see the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"
msgstr "Untuk semua input, nilai defaultnya, dan aturan validasi, lihat [referensi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This tutorial names the backend explicitly, uses the default values for `shots`, `session`, and `postprocessing_level`, and sets the classical seed. Collect the inputs in a dictionary so that you can pass them to `solver.run()` in Step 3.\n"
msgstr "Tutorial ini menyebutkan backend secara eksplisit, memakai nilai default untuk `shots`, `session`, dan `postprocessing_level`, dan menetapkan seed klasik. Kumpulkan input dalam sebuah dictionary supaya bisa diteruskan ke `solver.run()` di Langkah 3.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using primitives {#step-3-execute-using-primitives}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi menggunakan primitive {#step-3-execute-using-primitives}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the job with the SQOA Solver connection created in Step 1. The function runs the IBM Quantum Sampler primitive on the selected backend, collects the measured bitstrings, and continues with the classical diagonalization and post-processing. You interact with a single function job.\n"
msgstr "Kirim job dengan koneksi SQOA Solver yang dibuat di Langkah 1. Function menjalankan primitive IBM Quantum Sampler pada backend yang dipilih, mengumpulkan bitstring hasil pengukuran, lalu melanjutkan dengan diagonalisasi klasik dan pascapemrosesan. Anda hanya berinteraksi dengan satu function job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To check the status of the workload, see [Check job status](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status). Internally, the function proceeds through mapping, hardware optimization, queue waiting, QPU execution, and post-processing phases.\n"
msgstr "Untuk memeriksa status beban kerja, lihat [Periksa status job](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status). Secara internal, function melewati fase pemetaan, optimisasi perangkat keras, menunggu antrean, eksekusi QPU, dan pascapemrosesan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`job.result()` blocks until the job completes and returns a dictionary with the solution, its objective value and feasibility, and metadata that holds solver information and resource usage. For the full definition of the inputs and outputs, see the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"
msgstr "`job.result()` memblokir sampai job selesai dan mengembalikan dictionary berisi solusi, nilai objektif dan kelayakannya, serta metadata yang menyimpan informasi solver dan penggunaan sumber daya. Untuk definisi lengkap input dan output, lihat [referensi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process the result and convert it to a classical format {#step-4-post-process-the-result-and-convert-it-to-a-classical-format}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pascapemrosesan hasil dan konversi ke format klasik {#step-4-post-process-the-result-and-convert-it-to-a-classical-format}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect the complete function output, map the returned assignment back to the graph, verify the selected nodes, and visualize the result.\n"
msgstr "Periksa output function secara lengkap, petakan penetapan yang dikembalikan kembali ke graf, verifikasi node yang dipilih, dan visualisasikan hasilnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inspect the result {#inspect-the-result}"
msgstr "Memeriksa hasil {#inspect-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result dictionary contains four top-level fields:\n"
msgstr "Dictionary hasil berisi empat field tingkat atas:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`solution` is the complete variable assignment, keyed by `x_i`, where _i_ is the variable index (for example, `x_17`). In this tutorial, the variable index is the node label.\n"
msgstr "`solution` adalah penetapan variabel lengkap, dengan kunci `x_i`, di mana _i_ adalah indeks variabel (misalnya, `x_17`). Dalam tutorial ini, indeks variabel adalah label node.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`objective_value` is the objective of that assignment evaluated on the submitted dictionary, that is, on the minimization QUBO.\n"
msgstr "`objective_value` adalah nilai objektif dari penetapan tersebut yang dievaluasi pada dictionary yang dikirim, yaitu pada QUBO minimisasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`feasible` refers only to the variable domain, because the dictionary has no constraints.\n"
msgstr "`feasible` hanya merujuk pada domain variabel, karena dictionary tidak memiliki batasan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`metadata` contains `solver_info` and `resource_usage`. `solver_info` records the effective `seed` of the run. If the classical local search ran, `solver_info` also records the rounded assignment from before that refinement in `solution_before_postprocessing`.\n"
msgstr "`metadata` berisi `solver_info` dan `resource_usage`. `solver_info` mencatat `seed` efektif dari proses tersebut. Jika local search klasik dijalankan, `solver_info` juga mencatat penetapan terbulatkan dari sebelum penyempurnaan itu di `solution_before_postprocessing`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the solution to the graph {#map-the-solution-to-the-graph}"
msgstr "Memetakan solusi ke graf {#map-the-solution-to-the-graph}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Collect the returned values in the order of the variable indices, and map them back to the variables of the original problem with `interpret()`. The selected nodes are the variables with the value 1, and `is_feasible()` checks the assignment against the edge constraints of the original problem.\n"
msgstr "Kumpulkan nilai yang dikembalikan menurut urutan indeks variabel, lalu petakan kembali ke variabel masalah asli dengan `interpret()`. Node yang dipilih adalah variabel bernilai 1, dan `is_feasible()` memeriksa penetapan terhadap batasan sisi dari masalah asli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the solution before post-processing {#compare-with-the-solution-before-post-processing}"
msgstr "Membandingkan dengan solusi sebelum pascapemrosesan {#compare-with-the-solution-before-post-processing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because `postprocessing_level` is `1`, `solver_info` also records the rounded assignment from before the classical local search in `solution_before_postprocessing`. It uses the same keys as `solution`.\n"
msgstr "Karena `postprocessing_level` bernilai `1`, `solver_info` juga mencatat penetapan terbulatkan dari sebelum local search klasik di `solution_before_postprocessing`. Ia memakai kunci yang sama dengan `solution`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Evaluate it on the QUBO to see how much the refinement improved the result. Both values are objectives of the submitted minimization QUBO, so a lower value is better. The field is omitted when the local search does not run, for example, when presolve fixes every variable.\n"
msgstr "Evaluasi pada QUBO untuk melihat seberapa besar penyempurnaan memperbaiki hasil. Kedua nilai adalah nilai objektif dari QUBO minimisasi yang dikirim, jadi nilai yang lebih rendah lebih baik. Field ini dihilangkan ketika local search tidak dijalankan, misalnya, ketika presolve sudah menetapkan semua variabel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify the independence constraint {#verify-the-independence-constraint}"
msgstr "Memverifikasi batasan independensi {#verify-the-independence-constraint}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the QUBO represents adjacency through penalty terms rather than explicit constraints, a heuristic result can still select adjacent nodes. Check the returned nodes directly against the graph. For the comparison and visualization in the following sections, copy the returned set and greedily remove one endpoint of each detected conflict.\n"
msgstr "Karena QUBO merepresentasikan keterhubungan lewat suku penalti, bukan batasan eksplisit, hasil heuristik masih bisa memilih node yang bertetangga. Periksa node yang dikembalikan langsung terhadap graf. Untuk perbandingan dan visualisasi di bagian berikutnya, salin himpunan yang dikembalikan dan hapus secara greedy satu ujung dari setiap konflik yang terdeteksi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare with the reference solution {#compare-with-the-reference-solution}"
msgstr "Membandingkan dengan solusi referensi {#compare-with-the-reference-solution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In Step 1, you downloaded the objective value of the [QOBLIB reference solution](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset/solutions). QOBLIB reference solutions can be optimal or best-known, so compare against the reference objective without assuming that it is always a certified optimum.\n"
msgstr "Di Langkah 1, Anda mengunduh nilai objektif dari [solusi referensi QOBLIB](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset/solutions). Solusi referensi QOBLIB bisa optimal atau terbaik yang diketahui, jadi bandingkan dengan objektif referensi tanpa mengasumsikan bahwa itu selalu optimum yang tersertifikasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For this maximization problem, a ratio of 1.0 means that the repaired result matches the reference objective.\n"
msgstr "Untuk masalah maksimisasi ini, rasio 1.0 berarti hasil yang sudah diperbaiki sama dengan objektif referensi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the result {#visualize-the-result}"
msgstr "Memvisualisasikan hasil {#visualize-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot the graph again with the repaired independent set highlighted. No two highlighted nodes share an edge.\n"
msgstr "Plot graf sekali lagi dengan independent set yang sudah diperbaiki disorot. Tidak ada dua node yang disorot yang berbagi sisi.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/41f062f0-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/maximum-independent-set-jij-sqoa/extracted-outputs/41f062f0-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read the resource usage {#read-the-resource-usage}"
msgstr "Membaca penggunaan sumber daya {#read-the-resource-usage}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result metadata reports `CPU_TIME` for phases other than `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`, when it is available. The `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` phase can report `QPU_TIME`, the QPU usage returned by Quantum Compute, if the final usage is available for every Quantum Compute job.\n"
msgstr "Metadata hasil melaporkan `CPU_TIME` untuk fase selain `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`, jika tersedia. Fase `RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU` dapat melaporkan `QPU_TIME`, penggunaan QPU yang dikembalikan oleh Quantum Compute, jika penggunaan akhir tersedia untuk setiap job Quantum Compute.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion {#conclusion}"
msgstr "Kesimpulan {#conclusion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, you downloaded an MIS instance from QOBLIB, formulated it as a QUBO with `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper`, connected to SQOA Solver, configured and submitted the workload, mapped the returned assignment back to the graph, and checked the selected nodes against the original graph.\n"
msgstr "Dalam tutorial ini, Anda mengunduh instans MIS dari QOBLIB, merumuskannya sebagai QUBO dengan `qiskit-addon-opt-mapper`, terhubung ke SQOA Solver, mengonfigurasi dan mengirim beban kerja, memetakan penetapan yang dikembalikan kembali ke graf, dan memeriksa node yang dipilih terhadap graf asli.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You also compared the result with the QOBLIB reference solution, examined the contribution of the classical post-processing, and inspected the resource usage of each execution phase.\n"
msgstr "Anda juga membandingkan hasil dengan solusi referensi QOBLIB, memeriksa kontribusi pascapemrosesan klasik, dan memeriksa penggunaan sumber daya dari setiap fase eksekusi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver combines presolve, QRAO with a QRAC-based encoding, sampling-circuit construction, hardware-aware transpilation, sample-based diagonalization, rounding, and classical refinement. This workflow can map more binary variables than a one-variable-per-qubit encoding would allow. The amount of reduction from presolve and encoding depends on the problem structure, and solution quality depends on the samples obtained.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver menggabungkan presolve, QRAO dengan encoding berbasis QRAC, konstruksi circuit sampling, transpilasi yang sadar perangkat keras, diagonalisasi berbasis sampel, pembulatan, dan penyempurnaan klasik. Alur kerja ini dapat memetakan lebih banyak variabel biner daripada yang diizinkan encoding satu-variabel-per-qubit. Besarnya reduksi dari presolve dan encoding bergantung pada struktur masalah, dan kualitas solusi bergantung pada sampel yang diperoleh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `shots` and `postprocessing_level` settings control the quantum sampling budget and the classical refinement, respectively, without changing the submission workflow.\n"
msgstr "Pengaturan `shots` dan `postprocessing_level` masing-masing mengendalikan anggaran sampling kuantum dan penyempurnaan klasik, tanpa mengubah alur kerja pengiriman.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Appendix: Submit the problem as an OMMX instance {#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance}"
msgstr "Lampiran: Kirim masalah sebagai instans OMMX {#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver also accepts an `ommx.v1.Instance` from the [OMMX](https://jij-inc.github.io/ommx/en/introduction.html) SDK. The [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/) package distributes the QOBLIB problems as OMMX instances together with their reference solutions, so you can load the same QUBO without formulating it yourself.\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver juga menerima `ommx.v1.Instance` dari SDK [OMMX](https://jij-inc.github.io/ommx/en/introduction.html). Paket [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/) mendistribusikan masalah QOBLIB sebagai instans OMMX beserta solusi referensinya, sehingga Anda bisa memuat QUBO yang sama tanpa merumuskannya sendiri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With an OMMX input, `objective_value` is evaluated in the sense of the instance, and the result also contains the canonical `ommx.v1.Solution`. Install the package, which also installs the OMMX SDK:\n"
msgstr "Dengan input OMMX, `objective_value` dievaluasi menurut makna instans tersebut, dan hasilnya juga memuat `ommx.v1.Solution` kanonik. Pasang paketnya, yang juga memasang SDK OMMX:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Load the `binary_unconstrained` model of the same instance. The dataset loader prints progress messages, so the code captures them to keep the output compact.\n"
msgstr "Muat model `binary_unconstrained` dari instans yang sama. Pemuat dataset mencetak pesan progres, jadi kode menangkapnya agar output tetap ringkas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQOA Solver receives an OMMX instance as a standard padded Base64 string and returns the canonical solution in the same format. Define two helper functions for this conversion:\n"
msgstr "SQOA Solver menerima instans OMMX sebagai string Base64 berpadding standar dan mengembalikan solusi kanonik dalam format yang sama. Definisikan dua fungsi bantu untuk konversi ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`to_problem_payload()` serializes an `ommx.v1.Instance` into the string that you pass as `problem`.\n"
msgstr "`to_problem_payload()` men-serialize `ommx.v1.Instance` menjadi string yang Anda berikan sebagai `problem`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`to_ommx_solution()` decodes the canonical `ommx.v1.Solution` from the result.\n"
msgstr "`to_ommx_solution()` men-decode `ommx.v1.Solution` kanonis dari hasilnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the instance with the same inputs as before, replacing only `problem`. Then decode the canonical solution and read the selected nodes by variable name.\n"
msgstr "Kirim instance dengan input yang sama seperti sebelumnya, hanya ganti `problem`. Lalu decode solusi kanonis dan baca node yang terpilih berdasarkan nama variabelnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"* Apply the workflow to your own QUBO problems. Build an `OptimizationProblem` as shown in the [SQOA Solver guide](/guides/jij-sqoa-solver). The steps for conversion and submission remain the same, but adapt the validation to the structure of your problem.\n"
"* Submit the problem as an OMMX instance, as shown in the [appendix](#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance). See the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) for the accepted problem formats and the returned fields.\n"
"* Explore other independent-set instances in the [QOBLIB repository](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset) or through [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/).\n"
"* Learn more about modeling with [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper) or [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) and exchanging problems with [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"* Terapkan alur kerja ini pada masalah QUBO milikmu sendiri. Buat `OptimizationProblem` seperti yang ditunjukkan di [panduan SQOA Solver](/guides/jij-sqoa-solver). Langkah konversi dan pengiriman tetap sama, tetapi sesuaikan validasinya dengan struktur masalahmu.\n"
"* Kirim masalah sebagai instance OMMX, seperti yang ditunjukkan di [lampiran](#appendix-submit-the-problem-as-an-ommx-instance). Lihat [referensi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/jij-sqoa-solver) untuk format masalah yang diterima dan field yang dikembalikan.\n"
"* Jelajahi instance independent-set lainnya di [repositori QOBLIB](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/07-independentset) atau lewat [OMMX Quantum Benchmarks](https://jij-inc.github.io/OmmxQuantumBenchmarks/).\n"
"* Pelajari lebih lanjut tentang pemodelan dengan [qiskit-addon-opt-mapper](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-opt-mapper) atau [JijModeling](https://jij-inc-jijmodeling-tutorials-en.readthedocs-hosted.com/en/latest/introduction.html) dan pertukaran masalah dengan [OMMX](https://ommx-en-book.readthedocs.io/en/latest/).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

